<section>
	<h2 id="header">Header</h2>

	{# Top Bar #}
	{% part "content-includes/theme-header/top-bar" %}

	{# Logo #}
	{% part "content-includes/theme-header/logo" %}

	{# Favicon #}
	{% part "content-includes/theme-header/favicon" %}

	{# Main Menu #}
	{% part "content-includes/theme-header/main-menu" %}

	{# After Header #}
	{% part "content-includes/theme-header/after-header" %}
	<h3 id="featured-link">Featured Link Button</h3>
	<p>Configure the header button in <b>Appearance &gt; Customize &gt; [PT] Theme Options &gt; Navigation</b>. Choose a <b>Featured Link</b> page, set the button text above and below, or supply a custom URL. You can also open the link in a new window.</p>
	<h3 id="sticky-menu">Sticky Menu</h3>
	<p>In <b>[PT] Theme Options &gt; Sticky Menu</b>, enable the sticky menu and choose its visibility. This menu has separate button, background color and logo settings.</p>
</section>